        "correct": "$60 = 1 \\times 60$ ، $60 = 2 \\times 30$ ، $60 = 3 \\times 20$ ، $60 = 4 \\times 15$ ، $60 = 5 \\times 12$ ، $60 = 6 \\times 10$.",
